    "body": "Main was merged into this branch.\n\nOne file conflicted: `crates/ui/src/egui_app/sinker_machine_tests.rs`. Both sides added a separate test, so the resolution keeps both.\n\nMain also changed `stated_num` in `machine_edm_editor.rs`: it now takes a `Unit`. The wear-rate row of this branch had the old call. I added `stated_plain` for a value with no unit (a ratio). Both functions share one helper, `stated_with`. The wear-rate row now calls `stated_plain` and shows the same input as before.\n\nTests run, all passed: the 9 `sinker_machine` lib tests of camcraft-ui. These include `the_sinker_machine_editor_names_every_input` from main and the wear and notes tests of this branch.\n\nThe merge needs a delta review of the `machine_edm_editor.rs` change.\n",
